Lightweight apps and PWAs, small payloads, offline tolerance (I02 L3). ~19,000 plus pincodes with uneven courier reach:

21
00:01:38.832 --> 00:01:42.736
Serviceability and promise computed per pincode (VERIFY count).

22
00:01:43.016 --> 00:01:44.744
Cash on delivery still common:

23
00:01:45.024 --> 00:01:50.848
COD risk scoring, cash reconciliation, RTO management (I02 L2).

24
00:01:51.128 --> 00:01:52.280
Many languages:

25
00:01:52.560 --> 00:01:55.440
Vernacular UI, transliteration, voice search.

26
00:01:55.720 --> 00:01:57.448
Festive sale concentration:

27
