Listing: match to an existing catalog product, or create a new listing with attributes per category;. quality checks on images and content, with ML models detecting prohibited items, counterfeit indicators and poor images.

113
00:10:11.419 --> 00:10:16.987
Inventory and pricing: sellers manage stock and prices through the portal or APIs.

114
00:10:17.267 --> 00:10:20.617
Pricing recommendations suggest competitive prices.

115
00:10:21.967 --> 00:10:27.748
Orders: notifications with dispatch SLAs, labels and manifests, and pickup scheduling.

116
00:10:28.028 --> 00:10:41.831
Settlement: the platform collects payments;. it deducts commission, fees (fixed, shipping, collection) and taxes (TCS under GST, VERIFY);. it settles to the seller on a schedule, with detailed statements.

117
00:10:42.111 --> 00:10:43.796
This needs a per-seller ledger.

118
00:10:45.146 --> 00:10:52.399
Performance: metrics (cancellation, late dispatch, returns) affect visibility and eligibility for programmes.

119
00:10:52.679 --> 00:10:56.285
Ads: sellers buy sponsored placements with bids and budgets.

